      "statement": "`packages/ui` declares no scripts at all (no `build`, `test`, `lint` or `dev`), ships TypeScript source resolved by the consumer toolchain, and has no test files; its only verification is the root chain — `tsc --noEmit -p packages/ui/tsconfig.json` as the first of five projects in the root `typecheck` script, `eslint .` through the root flat config, and the root prettier glob `**/*.{ts,tsx,md}`.",
