      "statement": "Lint configuration is owned solely by the root flat config: `eslint.config.mjs` is the only ESLint configuration in the repository, `pnpm lint` runs a bare `eslint .` rather than `turbo run lint`, its `webUiFiles` globs cover `packages/ui/**/*.{ts,tsx}` with `react-hooks/rules-of-hooks` as an error, `react-hooks/exhaustive-deps` and `react-refresh/only-export-components` as warnings, browser globals and `@typescript-eslint/no-non-null-assertion` off, while `serverFiles` gives `apps/server` and `packages/shared` node globals and `eslint-config-expo/flat.js` is re-scoped to `apps/mobile`.",
